{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[C]Get out of my life woman I don’t love you no more
[F]Get out of my life woman I don’t love you no [C]more
[Bb]Get out of my life woman [F]Nothing but heartaches are in [C]store
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
Get outta my eyes teardrops, I gotta see my way around
Get outta my eyes teardrops, I gotta see my way around
Get outta my eyes teardrops, nothing but heartaches by the pound
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
Get off my ladder, woman I got to climb up to the top
Get off my ladder, woman I got to climb up to the top
Get off my ladder, woman There is nothin that can make me stop
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
Get out the way, woman I got to be movin' on
Get out the way, woman I got to be movin' on
Get out the way, woman I got to be movin' on
